  "method": "One background-QoS thread in one process at a time, anonymous UNIX socket pairs. The candidate splits each contiguous read or write buffer at one third and invokes readv/writev. One unscored warmup per arm precedes eight pairs in alternating order. Per-call thread CPU covers the production pump with the same counters in both arms. Seeding, dispatch, and ordered byte verification are outside the timed interval. CPU changes apply to this local fixture only.",
