  "bound_basis": "Each pump call has one contiguous buffer and at most one payload syscall per direction. Subdividing it saves zero data syscalls per successful read/write pair. A new pending suffix is allocated only after a partial/blocked write, at most once per event and at most 256 KiB. Retry writes advance the offset in place. The archived bound covers suffix allocation and copying only. Connection records and changes to buffering, read-ahead, queue layout or scheduling are outside it.",
